`RUN-260830-d1a567` was a reviewer run for `TASK-260715-whtdsf` using `gpt-5.6-sol/medium` with `max_parallel 3`. It was cancelled by operator directive, ended with status `cancelled`, exit code 130, and completion reason `cancelled`. No verdict from that run is accepted or reused.

